<p>1. Quda Ke Ghar Mein Ali Ka Lahoo Bahaya Gaya.</p>

<p>Lehed Mein Binte Muhammed Sa., Ko Yun Rulaya Gaya.</p>

<p>2. Tadap Raha Hai Musalle Pe Fatahe Khaibar.</p>

<p>Sare Imam Pe Sajde Mein Zulm Dhaaya Gaya.</p>

<p>3. Janaza Jaan Ke Baba Ka Cheeq Uthi Zainab Sa.</p>

<p>Ali Asws. Ko Masjid E Koofa Se Aise Laaya Gaya.</p>

<p> 4. Salaam Bhi Nahi Karta Tha Koi Hyder Asws., Ko.</p>

<p>Har Aik Gaam Pe Moula Ka Dil Dukhaya Gaya.</p>

<p>5. Dame Aqeer Bhi Yeh Kehke Ro Rahe The Ali Asws,.</p>

<p>Meri Batool Sa., Ko Darbaar Mein Bulaya Gaya.</p>

<p>6. Kumail Aagayi Asghar Asws., Ki Yaad Moula Ko.</p>

<p>Jo Doodh Koozo'N Mein Bharkar Unhe Pilaya Gaya.</p>